Advanced CVC8.0 noise canceling microphone to monitor and counter ambient noise for crystal clear voice communication to meet open office and outdoor requirements;
With the unique dual-microphone design, one mic for captures your voice, another one for reducing background noise.
270° rotatable boom mic to suit for the left or right ear; 90° rotatable earpads designed for saving space to carry with you; 
Also, in order to fit for all sizes of head, the Mpow HC5 noise canceling headset with microphone provides 6 kinds of sizes for choosing.
Mpow HC5 office wireless headset supports up to 22 hours for talking in a 2 hous charging, over 200 hours standby time.
The leather padded headband is lightweight and provides the right clamping force for a fit; 
Soft leatherette earpads are cushioned and breathable, so your ears don't get hot; Also, the earmuffs have about 8° for adjustment to fit your ears automatically. 
The Bluetooth 5.0 technology has a significant effect on power optimization and signal, which can significantly extend the battery life and improve the signal stability of the Bluetooth headset;
Flexibility to move up to 50 feets or 15m away from your connected device;You can connect two devices at the same time, and easily switch between them.
Hands Free Simple Operation
Highlights
Package Contens
1×Mpow HC5 Bluetooth headset1×3.5mm audio cable1×User manual
